      "content": "sometimes i just sit here and wonder if the pain will ever actually stop, or if it’s just meant to be this forever. it feels like i'm just waiting for something to happen, but i'm so tired of waiting. i just want to be where he is. i feel like i'm just stuck in this half-life, and it's so lonely.",
